  "releaseNotes": "v3.229.11:\n\t\t\t- Added JSON export/import support for LogicModules (compatible with modern LogicMonitor UI format)\n\t\t\t- New methods: GetDataSourceJsonAsync, GetEventSourceJsonAsync, GetConfigSourceJsonAsync, etc.\n\t\t\t- New methods: ImportDataSourceJsonAsync, ImportEventSourceJsonAsync, ImportConfigSourceJsonAsync, etc.\n\t\t\t- New file-based export/import: ExportLogicModuleToJsonFileAsync, ImportDataSourceFromJsonFileAsync, etc.\n\t\t\t- Generic methods: GetLogicModuleJsonAsync and GetLogicModuleXmlAsync by LogicModuleType\n\t\t\t- Security: Updated Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Abstractions to 10.0.1",
